# The three backdrop stages of level $10 (act 5, stage 2): PlayField3Stages
# ($81:C9F2, parallax kind $10). The level's own runs never reach the
# stage's end at x $0F10, so: Aladdin placed at x $0F20 with the camera
# short of $0F80 (stage 0 asks PlayerOnFirmGround, $81:CA11); then with the
# camera past $0F80 (the stage ends at once, $81:CA1B), the backdrop's y
# eased back to 0 from below (it is -$29 there) and, poked to $34, from
# above (every clamp of $81:CA22-$CA49); in stage 2 the camera's x is put
# past $1000 (its half-speed x, $81:CA5E), inside the level's limit $10A0.
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a5_s2.state
wait 2
poke 0008E7 20,0F
poke 001773 C0,0E
wait 30
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a5_s2.state
wait 2
poke 0008E7 20,0F
poke 001773 90,0F
wait 40
poke 0008E7 F0,10
wait 120
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a5_s2.state
wait 2
poke 0008E7 20,0F
poke 001773 90,0F
wait 5
poke 0018CD 34,00
wait 30
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a5_s2.state
wait 2
poke 0008E7 20,0F
poke 001773 90,0F
wait 20
poke 001773 40,10
wait 10
